## Mittelwert {.smaller}

:::: {.columns}

::: {.column width="70%"}

Stichprobe von $n$ Beobachtungen $x_1, x_2, ..., x_n$
$$
\bar{x}=\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}x_i = \frac{x_1+x_2+...+x_n}{n}
$$
:::

::: {.column width="30%"}

::: {.cell}
::: {.cell-output-display}


| ID| Groesse|
|--:|-------:|
|  1|     170|
|  2|     160|
|  3|     169|
|  4|     182|
|  5|     173|


:::
:::

:::

::::

::: {.callout-note}
## Beispiel
$x_1=170,x_2=160,x_3=169,x_4=182,x_5=173$

$$
\bar{x}=\frac{170+160+169+182+173}{5} = 170.8
$$
:::

